				"intro": "In this approach, you carry out the instillation yourself while lying down or in a semi-reclined position. The main aim is to find a position that gives you enough access, visibility, reach, and control to place the UroDapter correctly and operate the syringe comfortably. A mirror can be especially helpful while you are learning.",
